@gateway = http://localhost:8080/api
@adminUsername = admin
@adminPassword = admin-dev-secret-CHANGE-ME

### 1. Onboard a dealer. Copy `id` from the response into @tenantId below.
POST {{gateway}}/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Builders" }

### Set this to the id returned by the onboarding request.
@tenantId = REPLACE_WITH_TENANT_UUID

### 2. Dealer login. Copy token into @tenantToken.
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}" }

@tenantToken = REPLACE_WITH_DEALER_JWT

### 3. Admin login. Copy token into @adminToken.
POST {{gateway}}/auth/admin-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "{{adminUsername}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT

### 4. Dealer catalog
GET {{gateway}}/catalog/{{tenantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 5. Provision demo credit (existing Phase 2 setup endpoint)
POST {{gateway}}/credit/{{tenantId}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "creditLimit": 100000 }

### 6. Dealer submits a limit increase request
POST {{gateway}}/credit/{{tenantId}}/limit-increase-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requestedAmount": 150000, "reason": "Seasonal construction demand" }

### 7. Admin views the pending queue. Copy its `id` into @requestId.
GET {{gateway}}/admin/limit-increase-requests?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

@requestId = REPLACE_WITH_REQUEST_UUID

### 8. Admin approves; this writes the unified credit override audit row.
POST {{gateway}}/admin/limit-increase-requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Admin manual override (must not be below current outstanding).
PATCH {{gateway}}/credit/{{tenantId}}/limit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newLimit": 175000, "overrideReason": "Approved after payment history review" }

### 10. Dealer places an order; copy invoiceId into @invoiceId.
POST {{gateway}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "sku": "SKU-001", "qty": 2, "unitPrice": 4500.00 }] }

@invoiceId = REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_UUID

### 11. Dealer sees orders and invoices.
GET {{gateway}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

###
GET {{gateway}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 12. Mark the invoice paid; Credit consumes its event and releases exposure.
POST {{gateway}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/mark-paid
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 13. Admin dashboard API calls.
GET {{gateway}}/admin/utilization
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{gateway}}/admin/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{gateway}}/admin/reports/monthly/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Rejection path: submit then reject a second request.
POST {{gateway}}/credit/{{tenantId}}/limit-increase-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requestedAmount": 200000, "reason": "Example rejection path" }

### Fetch its id from the queue, set @requestId, then:
POST {{gateway}}/admin/limit-increase-requests/{{requestId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
